                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "text_QHhKhY": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>In 2020, founder Dwayne Jackson II built Legendary Branding to be more than just another streetwear brand, he built it to be a platform. </p><p>Designed as a parent company for a diverse lineup of sub-brands, Legendary connects streetwear heads, minimalists, and creators through one shared standard of excellence.</p><p>The G.O.A.T, represents that standard.</p><p>Which stands for the Greatest Of All Trends. With premium fabrics, high-GSM materials, and bold graphics, we are building a legacy that adapts to the culture while staying fiercely true to its roots. </p><p>The movement has just begun.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "center",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
