              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Once your order is locked in, we get straight to work. Legendary Branding uses a premium <strong>print-on-demand</strong> process, meaning your gear is custom-printed using <strong>advanced DTG technology</strong> as soon as you hit purchase. </p><p>After a brief production period and a strict quality check to ensure the <strong>heavyweight fabric</strong> and <strong>bold graphics</strong> meet our standards, your order is securely packaged and shipped. </p><p>You’ll receive <strong>tracking information</strong> right away so you can monitor your drop all the way to your doorstep.<br/><br/></p>",
